case模板：
2324所有path全违例，3411含有spef，13855作为4个path group 双sdc基准,13178仅含两ff

查看指定时序路径电路图命令：
set path [get_timing_paths -from ethmac/miim1/LatchByte_reg_0_ -to ethmac/miim1/shftrg/LinkFail_reg -path_type full_clock_expanded]
change_selection [get_attribute [get_attribute $path  points] object]
change_selection [get_attribute [get_attribute [get_attribute $path capture_clock_paths] points] object] -add
change_selection [get_attribute [get_attribute [get_attribute $path launch_clock_paths] points] object] -add

